  "schema": "depcheck.security-corpus-truth.v1",
  "scope": "Fixed advisory package/version membership and fix candidates only; synthetic public-origin inventory assertions, not installation, reachability, exploitation, current database coverage or general accuracy.",
  "annotation_method": "Manual labels from the pinned affected ranges, explicit version assertions and published first-patched versions, without running depcheck. Prerelease cases use OSV boundary ordering, not package-manager dependency selector admission. known_affected is null for private, unqualified or invalid coordinates; expected unknown states remain distinct from known upstream affectedness. Go prerelease and pseudo-version strings are version-boundary probes against the retained 0-to-0.17.0 range, not assertions that those tags or commits exist.",
